    "updated_at": "2020-10-01T19:32:14Z",
    "body": "I believe this happens here because your prompt doesn't integrate with starship enough.\r\n\r\nPlain `starship prompt` is not enough for starship to know the exit code of the last command. You need to pass the exit command of the last command to `starship prompt` with the `--status` argument. The `--cmd-duration`, `--keymap`  and `--jobs` arguments are also missing.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
